4,1,,status,Midori,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Thank you all for being here. To ensure we select a sustainable program, I believe we must first understand our actual financial boundaries and the potential for these programs to generate revenue.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Financial boundaries are a start, but sustainability requires more than just a budget. We need to know if previous initiatives actually improved patient outcomes, or if we're just adding to a pile of forgotten projects.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree with both of you. However, I'm also worried about the people implementing these programs. We must ensure we aren't overloading our staff or creating imbalances in the rosters. Harmony in the workplace is essential for success.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I agree! But we also have to make sure the hospital can actually handle more people. If the rooms are full or the booking system crashes, it won't matter how great the program is, right?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,You all make such wonderful points. I only worry that we might forget the promises made to those outside our walls. Let us ensure our partnerships are firm and truly agreed upon by everyone involved.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree. To avoid the common mistake of underfunding the operational side later, we should examine the ledger and the regional fund tariffs to see what we can truly afford and earn.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"If we want to avoid repeating past failures, we need hard data. I'll look into the readmission figures from the call-back trial and the shared nursing round completion to see what actually worked.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I think it's vital to see who is actually available to work. I'll look into the ward nursing vacancies and agency cover, as well as the therapy and midwifery staffing review, to protect our teams from burnout.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"That sounds like a plan! I'll check the rooms, parking and shuttle coverage, and also what the booking system records. We need to know if there's actually space for everyone to get in!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I shall look into the board minutes on the jointly run clinic and the data agreements with outside surgeries. It is so important that our friends and partners are truly on board with us.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"It seems we have a comprehensive plan. By covering the finances, staffing, infrastructure, and partnerships, we can avoid any hidden costs or operational gaps that might arise after the initial launch.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,"Let's hope this isn't just another exercise in optimism. I'm interested to see if the data actually supports any of these ambitions, or if we're simply ignoring the ghosts of previous failures.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I hope so too, Shion. If we can align our goals with the actual capacity of our staff, we can create something that truly helps patients without sacrificing the wellbeing of our colleagues.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'm just excited to see what we find! If we can make sure the building and the systems can handle the new program, then everything should run smoothly for everyone.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"It is lovely to see us all working together so harmoniously. I believe that by looking at these details with care, we can build something that lasts and brings peace to everyone involved.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I believe we are in agreement. Let us proceed with these investigations so we can make a decision based on reality rather than assumptions. I look forward to hearing what you all discover.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shion,,Indeed. I'll be waiting to see if the numbers provide a reality check or if we're just continuing a tradition of hopeful guesswork. Let's see what the data actually says.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Midori,,I'm looking forward to it as well. I truly hope we find a path that supports both our patients and the hardworking people who make this hospital run. See you all in the next round.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Kenji,,Me too! I'll dive into those records and see if we have enough room for everyone. I can't wait to share what I find with you all! See you soon!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I shall do the same. I look forward to our next meeting, and I hope we find a path that is kind to everyone. Until then, please take care of yourselves.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
